message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "dagsched: fault-tolerant scheduling of multi-agent task graphs"
abstract: >-
  A discrete-event simulator, scheduling policies (FIFO, random, critical-path,
  online HEFT-style), a failure/retry/duplicate-delivery model with idempotent result
  collection, and reproducible experiments on synthetic task graphs.
